{"data": [{"author_id": "2012477408583008256", "created_at": "2026-11-02T16:36:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117294716207448224"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 5, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 0, "username": "grok"}]}, "id": "2117294716207448224", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok where is Russia on the AI front in terms of export controls similar to China on advanced lithography chips?", "url": "https://x.com/PigeonWittle/status/2117294716207448224"}, {"author_id": "2112610428899479552", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:05:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117105743497220326"], "id": "2117105743497220326", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Mark November 10. That's the day the suspension of China's rare-earth export controls expires — with no extension announced. Gallium, germanium, antimony and graphite follow on November 27. The broader U.S.–China truce and the BIS affiliates-rule suspension run to January 10.", "url": "https://x.com/indopacsitrep/status/2117105743497220326"}, {"author_id": "2111659364004298752", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:52:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117057206646640764"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/L4XTiiNOYn", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/kvale_6077/status/2117057206646640764/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117057189076500480", "start": 244, "url": "https://t.co/L4XTiiNOYn"}]}, "id": "2117057206646640764", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Washington is closing a loophole that let Chinese entities remotely access advanced U. S. AI computing via overseas cloud servers, expanding export controls from chips to cloud resources as AI becomes central to economic and national security. https://t.co/L4XTiiNOYn", "url": "https://x.com/kvale_6077/status/2117057206646640764"}, {"author_id": "1702688784255451136", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:29:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117338388739059908"], "id": "2117338388739059908", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 96, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1/4 Effective export controls on its most advanced chips are critical for U.S. national security, providing the country a capability lead and allowing for the hardening of critical infrastructure and government systems against AI-enabled cyber threats.", "url": "https://x.com/iapsAI/status/2117338388739059908"}, {"author_id": "2106704046153138177", "created_at": "2026-11-02T08:37:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117174201308139942"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 274, "start": 271, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 279, "start": 275, "tag": "LLM"}], "urls": [{"description": "原生多模态模型，为智能体任务而生。", "display_url": "meituan.com/news/NN2611022…", "end": 270, "expanded_url": "https://www.meituan.com/news/NN261102280001343", "images": [{"height": 100, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117174215052787712/6Vq5jxgj?format=png&name=orig", "width": 100}, {"height": 100, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117174215052787712/6Vq5jxgj?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 100}], "start": 247, "status": 200, "title": "美团发布LongCat-2.5大模型，“国模国芯”实现新突破", "unwound_url": "https://www.meituan.com/news/NN261102280001343", "url": "https://t.co/prc8xkotXP"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/Ot8tCGoJGY", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/edgardnogueira/status/2117174201308139942/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117174199110307840", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/Ot8tCGoJGY"}]}, "id": "2117174201308139942", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meituan released LongCat-2.5: a 1.6T-param multimodal model for agents, trained entirely on Chinese chips. It scores between Claude Opus 4.8 and Opus 5 on benchmarks (Meituan-reported). API is live.\n\nAre export controls still slowing China's AI?\n\nhttps://t.co/prc8xkotXP\n#AI #LLM https://t.co/Ot8tCGoJGY", "url": "https://x.com/edgardnogueira/status/2117174201308139942"}, {"author_id": "1385379438146240515", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:58:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117255105007210733"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 259, "start": 256, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 277, "start": 260, "tag": "NationalSecurity"}]}, "id": "2117255105007210733", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China just rolled out its first frontier AI export controls via Mofcom Announcement No. 48. Beijing's moving to weaponize AI dominance while restricting outbound tech. The new arms race isn't missiles—it's models. And export controls are the new blockade. #AI #NationalSecurity...", "url": "https://x.com/JtCrawford/status/2117255105007210733"}, {"author_id": "2101226047744462848", "created_at": "2026-11-02T09:20:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117184973237317967"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/dBRkOrtrqu", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SiliconValleyPX/status/2117184973237317967/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117184943902371841", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/dBRkOrtrqu"}]}, "id": "2117184973237317967", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 2161, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 17}, "text": "Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang on whether export controls can keep AI chips out of China:\n\n\"They have datacenters that are sitting completely empty, fully powered.\"\n\n\"If they wanted to, they just gang up more chips, even if they're 7nm.\"\n\n\"So the idea that China won't be able to have AI https://t.co/dBRkOrtrqu", "url": "https://x.com/SiliconValleyPX/status/2117184973237317967"}, {"author_id": "1444016755807031309", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:39:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117355822615548088"], "id": "2117355822615548088", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 95, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Chips are the shortage of the moment. The stack is the contest that lasts.\n\nAmerican policy has focused on one layer of the AI stack: hardware. It is a real bottleneck, and it fits familiar tools like export controls. But the stack has seven layers, and the ones above the chip", "url": "https://x.com/scsp_ai/status/2117355822615548088"}, {"author_id": "1938813785881395200", "created_at": "2026-11-01T01:00:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116696871628685784"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/theinformation…", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/theinformation/status/2116598594924954075", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/x6QEuKNq09"}]}, "id": "2116696871628685784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 89, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116598594924954075", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Export controls cut off DeepSeek's chips. The money kept coming, from new places.\n\nPer The Information, DeepSeek doubled its round target to nearly $16B, with Tencent, CATL and state-owned institutions in, while black-market prices for Nvidia's top chips surged.\n\nA battery maker https://t.co/x6QEuKNq09", "url": "https://x.com/JianingXiong/status/2116696871628685784"}, {"author_id": "1519845837337071616", "created_at": "2026-11-02T02:12:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117077237266833638"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 263, "start": 256, "tag": "Taiwan"}]}, "id": "2117077237266833638", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Taiwan's economy ministry is weighing wider export controls on advanced chips, wafer materials, and tools to China as lawmakers hold Trade Act hearings. Closing gaps between equipment bans and chip diversion turns industrial strength into security policy. #Taiwan", "url": "https://x.com/stevedannasun/status/2117077237266833638"}, {"author_id": "6255082", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:08:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117257551129821669"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/rohanpaul_ai/s…", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2117206586859151576", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/gtnFi5P1IW"}]}, "id": "2117257551129821669", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 65, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117206586859151576", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Wow. A free Chinese open-weight model turned Firefox's public security fixes into working exploits, six releases in a row. Export controls cover the chips. Nothing covers the gap between a fix going public and users installing the update. Every open patch is now a recipe. https://t.co/gtnFi5P1IW", "url": "https://x.com/evisoft/status/2117257551129821669"}, {"author_id": "1294016945411563523", "created_at": "2026-11-02T07:17:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117154155873579305"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/tSRBYLuqyh", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/linasbeliunas/status/2117154155873579305/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117154063728951296", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/tSRBYLuqyh"}]}, "id": "2117154155873579305", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 781, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Chamath had his team turn Anthropic's S-1 risk factors into a word cloud to see what the company is actually afraid of.\n\nThe #1 risk: compute. Regulation is a close second.\n\nHow the fears rank by share of words:\n\n→ Compute: data centers, power, chips, grid, electricity, hardware https://t.co/tSRBYLuqyh", "url": "https://x.com/linasbeliunas/status/2117154155873579305"}, {"author_id": "1959229231", "created_at": "2026-11-01T06:16:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116776310299406629"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Dibyamartanda/…", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Dibyamartanda/status/2116764397792272423", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/XwsB3g0kLq"}]}, "id": "2116776310299406629", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 960, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116764397792272423", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "UnOp, go further. Need a regulatory fix covering controlled/dual-tech startups, including chips. This isn’t about defending Pixxel by any length, but spotlighting the deliberate Delaware-flip, often a non-negotiable US VC funding condition. The two-fold fix: sovereign safeguards https://t.co/XwsB3g0kLq", "url": "https://x.com/TheMinuend/status/2116776310299406629"}, {"author_id": "2110460342409039872", "created_at": "2026-11-01T16:00:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116923243420373450"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 190, "start": 174, "tag": "TechGeopolitics"}]}, "id": "2116923243420373450", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China's draft export controls on large AI models and advanced chip designs mark a shift: Beijing is now authoring rules in the tech competition, not just responding to them. #TechGeopolitics", "url": "https://x.com/ram_2157/status/2116923243420373450"}, {"author_id": "4890094909", "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:33:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117324265246601449"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{